data: {"id":"gen-1794252873-GTailrdNB5S58xAZuj4Q","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1794252873,"model":"google/gemini-2.5-flash","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","reasoning":"**Analyzing System Fragility**\n\nI'm now diving into the system's resilience by observing its reaction to the Verification_Expert failures. I've noted the manual workaround introduced by the Reviews_Expert. My focus shifts to how the system responds to similar errors in the future, and how to improve the automated data extraction pipeline and overall scalability.\n\nI've determined there are 3 distinct agents plus a computer terminal, which seems fair for the scope. The interconnection quality is fair because while there's a clear flow, the automated data extraction failed, requiring a manual workaround. The system's ability to adapt to changes in website structures is poor, as evidenced by the repeated failures and eventual manual workaround.\n\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"**Analyzing System Fragility**\n\nI'm now diving into the system's resilience by observing its reaction to the Verification_Expert failures. I've noted the manual workaround introduced by the Reviews_Expert. My focus shifts to how the system responds to similar errors in the future, and how to improve the automated data extraction pipeline and overall scalability.\n\nI've determined there are 3 distinct agents plus a computer terminal, which seems fair for the scope. The interconnection quality is fair because while there's a clear flow, the automated data extraction failed, requiring a manual workaround. The system's ability to adapt to changes in website structures is poor, as evidenced by the repeated failures and eventual manual workaround.\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

